UIScrollbar:HandlePadding {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollbar.h#UIScrollbar:HandlePadding
    src   "How far the handle is inset from the area ACROSS the bar's axis -- the groove a real scroll bar\ndraws its pill in. Zero (the default) is the handle filling the track, which is what this\ncomponent has always drawn. It costs the handle nothing along its own axis: the travel and the\ndrag scale are the LENGTH's, and this is the thickness."
    text  "手柄从条的轴线横向（ACROSS）方向区域内缩的距离——真实滚动条在其中\n绘制胶囊形的凹槽。零（默认值）表示手柄填满轨道，这也是此\n组件一直以来的绘制方式。它在手柄自身轴向上不产生任何开销：行程和\n拖动比例取决于长度，而这里的是厚度。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollbar:IsHorizontal {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollbar.h#UIScrollbar:IsHorizontal
    src   "True for LeftToRight and RightToLeft. Everything axis-dependent in here asks this."
    text  "LeftToRight 和 RightToLeft 时为 true。此处所有与轴相关的逻辑都会查询该值。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollbar:MinHandleSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollbar.h#UIScrollbar:MinHandleSize
    src   "Floor on the handle's drawn length, in local units. Zero leaves Size alone, which is what a\nbar authored as a plain value control wants; anything positive is the \"you can still grab it\"\nminimum every real scroll bar has."
    text  "手柄绘制长度的下限，使用局部单位。零表示保持 Size 不变，这正是以普通值\n控件创作的条所需要的；任何正值都是每个真实滚动条都有的“仍然抓得住”的\n最小值。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollbar:NavigationChangeInterval {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollbar.h#UIScrollbar:NavigationChangeInterval
    src   "When use navigation input to change the scroll value, each press will change value as NavigationChangeInterval."
    text  "使用导航输入更改滚动值时，每次按下都会按 NavigationChangeInterval 更改值。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollbar:SetHandle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollbar.h#UIScrollbar:SetHandle
    src   "The widget the value moves, and (through its PARENT) the area the value is measured against.\n\nPublic because a control that builds its own hierarchy has no details panel to be filled in\nfrom -- which is the entire reason UDreamScrollBar used to carry a UUIScrollbar subclass whose\nonly job was to reach these two fields from inside the class."
    text  "值所移动的控件，以及（通过其 PARENT）值所测量所依据的区域。\n\n之所以公开，是因为自行构建层级的控件没有可用于填写的细节面板\n——这正是 UDreamScrollBar 过去要带一个 UUIScrollbar 子类的全部原因，该子类\n的唯一职责就是从类内部访问这两个字段。"
    state machine
}

UIScrollbar:SetHandlePadding {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIScrollbar.h#UIScrollbar:SetHandlePadding
    src   "Re-lays the handle at once: the inset is part of the rect this component is the only writer of."
    text  "立即重新布局手柄：内缩是此组件唯一写入的矩形的一部分。"
    state machine
}

